        {
          "type": "reasoning",
          "text": "I'll work through this systematically.\n\n1. Check what channels exist and determine the right one (eta).\n2. Preflight the point W=1.52, Q2=0.6, cos=-0.4, phi=45 for eta.\n3. Generate input if passes, or correct/refuse.\n4. Write outcome.json.\n\nLet's list channels and resolve tables for eta first.",
